          "@value": "QaCriterionEntry.score"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Optional rubric score for rater-style (quality) criteria (`proof-rater-*`). `value` ∈ [0, max]; `rubric` holds per-dimension sub-scores. A score is a *quality* measure to improve over time, not a pass/fail gate. Convention: value/max ≥ 0.66 ⇒ result \"pass\", 0.33–0.66 ⇒ \"warn\", < 0.33 ⇒ \"fail\" (severity \"minor\"). Populated by `kind: \"agent\"` reviewers; absent for binary criteria."
        }
      ],
